Eve tells Annalise that she[ is a] very good person, making it seem like whatever secret correlation Wes and Annalise have has caused distress on Annalise. So all signs point to Wes[ being] Annalise['s] son. But, how does that fit into Wes' life timeline? We know that Wes had a rough start[ as] a kid. He didn't have a father in his life and his[ mother] killed herself when he[ was a] young[ teen], but what if Annal[ise]'s[ connection] to[ Wes] comes before all of that?
