=== Text #1 ===
> The lives of people have definitely changed with the help of[ technological] advancements, which you can see right away as you wake up. This includes Envoy America, which this website proudly mentions, especially that it contributes to the welfare of the society. Now that Envoy America is functioning as a one ride-sharing service, they focus on bringing D[ement]ia patients to their destination safe and sound. This is something that proves that their company is a customer[-]centered one, which definitely[ deserves a recognition]. This is why the D[ement]ia Society of[ America has] given[ them] the D[ement]ia SMART Award. Learn more about the award that has been given to them by clicking this link.
